{"seq":12,"slug":"automation","title":"自动化","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"自动化-简介\">自动化 简介</h1><p>自动化研究的是如何让机器、设备和系统在尽可能少的人工干预下，自动完成感知、判断和控制的全过程。从家里能恒温的空调、十字路口的红绿灯，到化工厂里上千个阀门的协同调度、汽车工厂里挥舞的机械臂，背后都是同一套思想：用反馈把&quot;目标&quot;和&quot;现状&quot;的差距持续缩小。自动化不是某一种具体技术，而是一种把复杂物理过程&quot;驯服&quot;成可控、可重复、可优化系统的工程方法论。</p>\n<p>这门学科之所以重要，是因为它是现代工业文明的&quot;神经系统&quot;。瓦特的离心调速器让蒸汽机走向稳定，催生了第一次工业革命；20 世纪的过程控制让石油、电力、钢铁这些大工业得以安全连续运转；今天的自动化又和人工智能、物联网深度融合，支撑着特斯拉的自动驾驶、富士康的&quot;熄灯工厂&quot;和电网的智能调度。可以说，凡是需要&quot;稳、准、快&quot;地控制某个物理量的地方，就有自动化的身影。它横跨电子、机械、计算机、数学多个领域，是典型的交叉学科。</p>\n<p>本学习空间将自动化的核心内容组织为四个章节。<strong>第一章 控制理论基础</strong> 从反馈、传递函数、PID 和系统稳定性讲起，建立&quot;如何让系统按我们的意愿运动&quot;的数学与直觉框架。<strong>第二章 传感器与执行器</strong> 关注自动化系统的&quot;感官&quot;和&quot;肌肉&quot;——如何把温度、位置、压力等物理量变成电信号，又如何用电机、阀门把控制指令变回物理动作。<strong>第三章 工业自动化系统</strong> 走进真实工厂，讲解 PLC、SCADA、DCS 和现场总线，理解大规模生产线是如何被统一编程和监控的。<strong>第四章 智能自动化与机器人</strong> 面向前沿，涵盖工业机器人、运动控制、机器视觉以及自动化与人工智能融合的新趋势。</p>\n<p>学习自动化最有效的方法是&quot;理论 + 动手&quot;两条腿走路。建议在理解每个控制概念时，都去找一个身边的实例对照——空调如何防止温度震荡、无人机如何保持悬停、扫地机器人如何规划路径。如果条件允许，用 Python（配合 control、matplotlib 库）或 MATLAB/Simulink 仿真一个简单的一阶、二阶系统，亲眼看看改变参数后曲线如何变化，这种&quot;看得见的反馈&quot;能让抽象的数学迅速变成你的直觉。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"control-theory-basics","title":"控制理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/control-theory-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feedback-and-control-concept","title":"大学自动化 — 反馈与控制的基本概念","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/control-theory-basics/feedback-and-control-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transfer-function-and-modeling","title":"大学自动化 — 传递函数与系统建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/control-theory-basics/transfer-function-and-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pid-control-and-stability","title":"大学自动化 — PID 控制与系统稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/control-theory-basics/pid-control-and-stability"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sensors-and-actuators","title":"传感器与执行器","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/sensors-and-actuators","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sensors-and-measurement","title":"大学自动化 — 传感器与测量原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/sensors-and-actuators/sensors-and-measurement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"actuators-and-motors","title":"大学自动化 — 执行器与电机驱动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/sensors-and-actuators/actuators-and-motors"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"industrial-automation","title":"工业自动化系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/industrial-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"plc-and-programming","title":"大学自动化 — PLC 与工业编程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/industrial-automation/plc-and-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scada-and-dcs","title":"大学自动化 — SCADA 与分布式控制系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/industrial-automation/scada-and-dcs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"industrial-networks","title":"大学自动化 — 工业网络与现场总线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/industrial-automation/industrial-networks"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"intelligent-automation","title":"智能自动化与机器人","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/intelligent-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-robots","title":"大学自动化 — 工业机器人与运动控制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/intelligent-automation/industrial-robots"},{"seq":2,"slug":"machine-vision","title":"大学自动化 — 机器视觉与图像处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/intelligent-automation/machine-vision"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-and-smart-manufacturing","title":"大学自动化 — 人工智能与智能制造","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/intelligent-automation/ai-and-smart-manufacturing"}]}]}